      "id": "packaging",
      "contract": "Eight named immutable adapters preserve compiled inputs, signing, App Intents and entitlement preparation; unknown, missing, duplicate or overlapping anchors fail closed.",
      "limitations": "Real historical upstream scripts are transformed as data, never executed by the rehearsal. Native artifact and device validation are separate.",
